# Copy to .env.local and adjust. These are read only on the server.
# API_BASE_URL=https://aftervibe_backend.test
# API_TENANT_ID=fbacb018-5726-47f5-b192-4a87e76f69f5
API_BASE_URL=https://voxxclub.vip
API_TENANT_ID=b8ca06a2-7a65-42b3-8672-ad39c788a65a

# Dev-only mock fallback (src/lib/mock/devFallback.ts). Only when NODE_ENV=development;
# production never shows mock data. Default on in dev: API reads that fail (network,
# timeout, 5xx) or return empty lists show mock data with a "MOCK" badge.
# 0 = off, force = always mock every read. In the browser, ?mock=force / ?mock=off
# toggles forced mode via a cookie. Mutations (gift, recharge, spin, redeem,
# check-in, comments) and 401/login never use mock data.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEV_MOCK_FALLBACK=1
